@startuml
title RAGapp Infrastructure & Frontend↔Backend Connections

package "Client" {
  [Browser] as Browser
  [Vite Dev Server\n(Frontend/RAGapp)] as Vite
  component "React App\n(Login, Register, Search, useAuth)" as React
  Browser --> Vite : loads dev bundle
  Vite --> React
}

package "Backend (FastAPI)" {
  [FastAPI\nBackend/BackendAPI.py] as API
  component "RAGEngine\nBackend/index.py" as RAGEngine
  component "Ingest Pipeline\nBackend/ingest.py" as Ingest
  database "User DB\n(backend database.py / models.py)" as UserDB
  folder "File Storage\nBackend/DocsToIngest/" as FileStore
  component "Embedding Provider\n(e.g. OpenAI)" as Embeddings
  database "Chroma Vector DB\nBackend/chroma_db/chroma.sqlite3" as Chroma
  component "PDF Loader / OCR" as PDFLoader
  
  API --> RAGEngine : /query, /files, /delete
  API --> UserDB : auth / user CRUD
  API --> FileStore : upload / serve files
  API --> Ingest
  RAGEngine --> Embeddings : get embeddings
  RAGEngine --> Chroma : persist & query vectors
  Ingest --> FileStore : reads PDFs
  Ingest --> PDFLoader : parse & split
  Ingest --> Embeddings : embeddings during ingest
  Ingest --> Chroma : write embeddings
}

React --> API : HTTP(S) REST (JSON)
note right of React
  - Query user input
  - File uploads
  - Auth (login/register)
end note

Chroma --> FileStore : stores metadata (file refs)
UserDB --> "SQLite / SQLAlchemy" : backend storage

@enduml